    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nO' Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers are delighted to bring Lake Cottage, Dawros More, Letterfrack, Connemara, Co. Galway to the market.\n\nSurrounded by the breathtaking landscape of Connemara, offering a truly exceptional opportunity to acquire a private retreat surrounded by outstanding natural beauty. \n\nLake Cottage is situated on a substantial private site of approximately 3.7 acres. The property benefits from direct frontage onto the lake and the remarkable advantage of owning half of the adjoining lake, together with associated fishing rights. \n\nThe residence extends to approximately 138.83 sq. m. and is a charming, well-proportioned home designed to make the most of its spectacular surroundings. Upon entering, a generous entrance hall provides a welcoming introduction to the accommodation.\n\nThe living room is full of character, featuring a solid fuel stove which creates a warm and inviting focal point. There is an elevated kitchen/ dining area which benefit from the views of the lake. \n\nThere are 3 well-proportioned bedrooms and two bathrooms, providing comfortable accommodation for family living or as a private holiday retreat. Heating is provided by oil-fired central heating, complemented by the solid fuel stove in the living room.\n\nThe extensive grounds are undoubtedly one of Lake Cottage's most outstanding features. The approximately 3.7-acre site provides a wonderful combination of open areas, mature planting and natural surroundings, while the established gardens are attractive and relatively easy to maintain.\n\nThe property is secured with private access with electric rolling gate. The property also benefits from a substantial 'Steeltech' garage, together with a second, smaller garden shed, providing excellent storage and practical outdoor facilities.\n\nThe location is particularly appealing. Lake Cottage is just a short drive from Letterfrack Village, where a range of local amenities can be found, including shops, bars, restaurants, schools and churches. \n\nLetterfrack is a vibrant and popular Connemara village and is widely recognised as the gateway to Connemara National Park. Clifden is also just a 15 minute drive from the property where all amenities can be availed of.\n\nThe renowned Connemara National Park provides an abundance of opportunities for walking and outdoor recreation, including the famous Diamond Hill trail, which can be seen from the property.\n\nBe sure not to miss out on this spectacular property and call O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers today to arrange a viewing. \n\nFor Further details please contact our office on 091-564212 \nOFFICE OPENING HOURS - MON TO FRI 9AM TO 5:30PM\n\nNOTE: These particulars are not to be considered a formal offer. They are for information only and give a general idea of the property. They are not to be taken as forming any part of a resulting contract, nor to be relied upon as statements or representations of fact. Whilst every care is taken in their preparation, neither O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers nor the vendor accept any liability as to their accuracy. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves by personal inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of these particulars. No person in the employment of O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property."
      },
